          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation from two different locations in Haut-Rhin (68) of the movement of several bright points in the sky: very likely observation of Thai lanterns.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "6bac0c7ba46b84031edb61a525ede9d36f50159bf32e3308676f287e5c097b34"
